From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:27:22 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] net/dns,wgengine: publish and filter explicitly owned DNS
 listeners

Use the configured local listener set when publishing resolver policy
and reading underlying DNS. Plain upstreams may use any formerly
reserved address. Supply the daemon listeners at its entry points.
